---
// src/pages/legal/disclaimer.astro
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important clarifications about the forward-looking, spiritual, and non-professional nature of the content on the Ember Ridge website."
  updated="[DATE TO BE SET AT LAUNCH]"
  intro="We would rather say less and mean it than say more and overstate. This page sets out what this site is — and what it is not."
>
  <h2>A ministry in formation</h2>
  <p>
    Ember Ridge is a vision under active discernment and development. The property
    described on this site has not been acquired, and buildings described — including the
    worship pavilion, prayer garden, and leadership residence — have not been designed,
    permitted, or built. References to acquisition, renovation, or construction describe
    intentions, not completed facts.
  </p>

  <h2>Forward-looking statements</h2>
  <p>
    Statements about future plans, timelines, capacity, programs, staffing, or budgets are
    based on present information and prayerful judgment. They may change materially as
    appraisal, inspection, survey, engineering, zoning, contractor pricing, board
    approval, funding, and circumstances direct. Nothing here should be relied upon as a
    promise of a future outcome.
  </p>

  <h2>Financial figures</h2>
  <p>
    Capital figures published on this site are preliminary planning ranges, not contractor
    bids, appraisals, or guaranteed project costs. They will be revised as real
    information is received. No representation is made that any project will be completed
    at a stated cost, on a stated schedule, or at all.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is an offer to sell or a solicitation of an offer to buy any
    security, partnership interest, or interest in real property.
  </p>

  <h2>Gifts and tax matters</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>[Needs legal review:</strong> confirm the tax status of Firebrand Revivalists
    and the correct language regarding deductibility of gifts, gift receipting, restricted
    gift handling, and charitable solicitation registration. Until counsel confirms this
    section, do not publish statements about tax treatment of gifts.<strong>]</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not provide tax advice. Please consult your own tax professional regarding the
    treatment of any gift.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Content on this site — including teaching, testimony, and written material — is
    offered for information and spiritual encouragement. It is not legal, financial, tax,
    accounting, medical, psychiatric, psychological, or counseling advice. Reading this
    site or contacting us does not create an attorney-client, therapist-client, pastoral
    care, or other professional relationship.
  </p>
  <p>
    Members of the leadership team hold professional credentials. Any professional
    services they may provide in another capacity are separate from this ministry, are
    governed by their own engagement agreements, and are not offered through this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Ministry, healing, and prayer</h2>
  <p>
    We believe God heals and restores. We also believe He works through physicians,
    counselors, and other qualified professionals. Nothing on this site should be
    understood as encouragement to discontinue medical or mental health treatment, to
    delay professional care, or to substitute prayer for necessary medical attention.
    Prayer offered by this ministry is not a diagnosis, treatment, or guarantee of any
    particular outcome.
  </p>

  <h2>Crisis and emergencies</h2>
  <p>
    This website and its contact form are not monitored continuously and are not an
    emergency service. If you are in immediate danger, please contact local emergency
    services. In the United States, the 988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline can be reached
    by calling or texting <strong>988</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>[Needs review:</strong> confirm crisis-resource references are current before
    launch.<strong>]</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>Historical and prophetic references</h2>
  <p>
    This site references historical accounts — including the Moravian prayer watch at
    Herrnhut, testimonies associated with Prayer Mountain and Moravian Falls, the Golden
    Candlestick fellowship, and a 1997 prophetic word concerning the area — as part of the
    spiritual testimony of the region. We receive such accounts with gratitude while
    keeping Scripture, humility, and wise discernment at the center. We do not present
    them as verified claims about present or future events, and we make no claim that any
    location produces spiritual results.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party content</h2>
  <p>
    Links to other organizations are provided for convenience. We do not control and are
    not responsible for their content, and a link is not an endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this disclaimer:
    <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
